# Findings the scan job (ceph-track.yml) does not gate on. One ID per line (CVE or GHSA), the line before it a
# "# reason" saying why it does not apply to this image. No entry without a reason; remove it when the cause is gone.

# certifi 2026.1.4 is flagged for the emSign roots in the cacert.pem it bundles. nixpkgs' certifi deletes that file and
# links certifi/cacert.pem to its cacert package's ca-bundle.crt (pkgs/development/python-modules/certifi, postPatch),
# so only the version string matches. Whether cacert still trusts emSign is a nixpkgs question; recheck on the next
# nixpkgs bump.
